<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"></head><body>Isaiah,<br><br>We're running low on 3D printer supplies in the engineering lab. Can you order the following?<br><br>- PLA filament, 1.75mm, white - 4 spools<br>- ABS filament, 1.75mm, black - 2 spools<br>- UV resin (standard grey) for the Formlabs - 2 liters<br>- IPA for resin part cleaning - 1 gallon<br><br>We use these for rapid prototyping and fixture mock-ups. With the Strato work ramping up, we're going through filament faster than usual. The last PLA order was from Hatchbox on Amazon - that brand has worked well for us.<br><br>No rush, but we'll be out of PLA within a week.<br><br>Thanks,<br>Pradeep Gupta<br>Senior Design Engineer<br>Waverly Industrial Solutions, Inc.</body></html>

